-- Tu12 table

opticsIMTu12Table OBJECT-TYPE
     SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF	OpticsIMTu12Entry
     MAX-ACCESS					not-accessible
     STATUS							current
     DESCRIPTION
          "This table contains the information related to the termination and to the origination of the TU12
